  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_01",
      "hash64": "67612DCF024CCD23",
      "text": "Oh! Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_02",
      "hash64": "67612ECF024CCED6",
      "text": "Welcome to my classroom. All the students here\\nare in the STEM track, just like me.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_03",
      "hash64": "67612FCF024CD089",
      "text": "So, uh...there’s something I wanna talk to\\nyou about.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_04",
      "hash64": "676130CF024CD23C",
      "text": "But not here. Let’s go somewhere we can talk\\nin private.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_05",
      "hash64": "676131CF024CD3EF",
      "text": "Th-this is my room. Make yourself at home.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "27F12B086542251A",
      "text": "It’s nice and cozy in here",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "27F12A0865422367",
      "text": "A little crowded, isn’t it?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_06",
      "hash64": "676132CF024CD5A2",
      "text": "Hehe. I know, right? Being surrounded by my\\nVeevees and figurines is my kinda heaven![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_07",
      "hash64": "676133CF024CD755",
      "text": "Wait, seriously? Is it the boxes from all my online\\norders? Maybe I oughta get rid of ’em, huh...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_08",
      "hash64": "676134CF024CD908",
      "text": "Anyway, you must be wondering why I brought\\nyou here. It’s about my Team Star friends.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_09",
      "hash64": "676135CF024CDABB",
      "text": "They...they really mean the world to me. I love\\nthem all so much that I got scared they weren’t\\r\\ngonna fit in OK or be happy at school.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_10",
      "hash64": "6764B2CF024FE4F9",
      "text": "That’s why I’ve been sorta spying on them since\\nthey came back.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_11",
      "hash64": "6764B1CF024FE346",
      "text": "But it turns out I didn’t need to worry.\\nThey’re already having a great time![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_12",
      "hash64": "6764B0CF024FE193",
      "text": "And now I feel bad that I didn’t have it in me to\\nbelieve in them in the first place...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_13",
      "hash64": "6764AFCF024FDFE0",
      "text": "They’ve all grown so much, but I haven’t changed\\nsince Operation Starfall.\\c\\nI’m still scheming up ways to fix things by myself\\ninstead of having a little faith.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_select_03",
      "hash64": "27F12908654221B4",
      "text": "It’s only natural you’d worry",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_select_04",
      "hash64": "27F1280865422001",
      "text": "You just need to believe in them!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_14a",
      "hash64": "000E45C0EDCD67AC",
      "text": "Y-you really think so? That’s a normal thing for\\nfriends to do?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_14b",
      "hash64": "000E48C0EDCD6CC5",
      "text": "Y-yeah. I know. I promise I’ll try, but it might take\\nme a little while to get there.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_15",
      "hash64": "6764B5CF024FEA12",
      "text": "Huh... I feel better after talking it out with you,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Thanks.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_16",
      "hash64": "6764B4CF024FE85F",
      "text": "And, um, I want you to know you’re a really\\nimportant friend to me, too.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_17a",
      "hash64": "000455C0EDC52E57",
      "text": "That goes for Nemona as well! And even Arven\\nand Koraidon![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_17b",
      "hash64": "000456C0EDC5300A",
      "text": "That goes for Nemona as well! And even Arven\\nand Miraidon![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_18",
      "hash64": "6764BACF024FF291",
      "text": "You know, I don’t normally like having people in\\nmy room.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_19",
      "hash64": "6764B9CF024FF0DE",
      "text": "But you’re an exception. Stop by for a chat\\nor whatever anytime![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_d_20",
      "hash64": "676838CF0252FE82",
      "text": "Till our next confab, then! Hasta la vistar! ☆[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
